      "content": "\"stepping out of the arena entirely\"... that sounds almost beautiful when you put it like that. It's like finally being able to just turn everything off. But I wonder if that's even possible without actually leaving everything behind for good. Like, is there really a way to find that kind of peace while you're still here, or is the only way to truly stop the noise to just... leave it all?",
